### 1. Register (Creates a new user & gets a token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "Tester",
  "lastname": "One",
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "groupName": "Class A"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
    client.log("Token: " + response.body.token);
%}

### 2. Get Questions (Uses the token automatically)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/questions/infinite
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Submit Answer for Question ID 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/questions/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "1"
}